    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491490/extras/c6532f6402b9c4ee6f1681e05d92c62b.avif?t=1753955973\" data-has-big width=800 height=231 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491490/extras/f660d9155c2b42ed8a77b825279a320d.poster.avif?t=1753955973\" width=800 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491490/extras/f660d9155c2b42ed8a77b825279a320d.webm?t=1753955973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491490/extras/f660d9155c2b42ed8a77b825279a320d.mp4?t=1753955973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Race Against <span class=\"bb_strike\">the Clock</span> Hourglass...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to help King Shorty, Archmage Tip has unleashed his magical prowess, and he's been able to cast a powerful spell that was capable of fragmenting time in <strong>turns</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each level of the Tower you must reach the stairs before the turns run out, otherwise there will be a gnome with a crown on his head no more!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491490/extras/9e718bcac2036c1a02d15c20c37eea91.avif?t=1753955973\" data-has-big width=800 height=231 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491490/extras/f990c39d3574355b8f1eafc4ceef4c9b.poster.avif?t=1753955973\" width=800 height=532 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491490/extras/f990c39d3574355b8f1eafc4ceef4c9b.webm?t=1753955973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491490/extras/f990c39d3574355b8f1eafc4ceef4c9b.mp4?t=1753955973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Army of Ruthless Creatures...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The King has <strong>many enemies</strong>, each one with different patterns and traits that shape the way you move and interact in a level. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Among the Invaders, there are:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nagas</strong> that ignore the holy power of the sunlight.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evil gnome warlocks\u00a0</strong>that teleport with a lethal beam.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Imps</strong> who like to take a nap every other step.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grumpy dwarves</strong>, <strong>greedy</strong>\u00a0<strong>goblins</strong>, and more...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend the life of the gnome monarch at all costs!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491490/extras/7d0f763290b1fe828f118c3ed10f50c1.avif?t=1753955973\" data-has-big width=800 height=191 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491490/extras/39b02fb2aa750fb4554d4ce44e016268.poster.avif?t=1753955973\" width=748 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491490/extras/39b02fb2aa750fb4554d4ce44e016268.webm?t=1753955973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491490/extras/39b02fb2aa750fb4554d4ce44e016268.mp4?t=1753955973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Tower of Dangers and Opportunities...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the best path to escape the Tower, and engage yourself with handcrafted levels that are filled with many and varied types of traps, mechanisms and enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >During your Perilous Descent you will Interact with:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Windows</strong> and <strong>Lights</strong> that will <strong>stun </strong>or\u00a0<strong>purify</strong>\u00a0your enemies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teleportation Platforms</strong> that help you, and the invaders, move accross a level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dangerous Spikes</strong> that kill anything that stands on them.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enchanted Doubloons</strong>, <strong>Spiked Chests</strong>, and more...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study the levels, be mindful of your steps, choose the right course of action and your escape will be certain!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491490/extras/0b0542fec65cbca046cae7dacf504388.avif?t=1753955973\" data-has-big width=800 height=231 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491490/extras/49b205d007ba61d65034ef516c2ca400.poster.avif?t=1753955973\" width=800 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491490/extras/49b205d007ba61d65034ef516c2ca400.webm?t=1753955973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491490/extras/49b205d007ba61d65034ef516c2ca400.mp4?t=1753955973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Peculiar Group of Advisors...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Telepaty Spell</strong> will allow you to know the <strong>advisors</strong> of King Shorty during his escape. Expect nothing but <strong>extravagant individuals!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who knows what you might discover? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone could be hiding a <strong>very unexpected</strong> secret...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Is This Game for You?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can't decide if this game is right for you? In that case, I invite you to try the <strong>free demo, which includes the entire first area of the game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, if you don't want to download the demo, the next section is for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>In short, you will like this game if:</u></i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You like turn-based games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You appreciate convoluted levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limits don't bother you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You like puzzle games where you are often stuck without immidiately grasping the reason.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You like to think ahead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You like crates.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't trust carpets.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>You will, most likely, dislike this game if:</u></i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You like games with fast and adrenalinic gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't like fantasy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't like silly humor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't like to be trapped.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't want to waste time stuck in the same level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't like to restart a level if you make a mistake.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel art is not for you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
