n't like silly humor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't like to be trapped.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't want to waste time stuck in the same level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't like to restart a level if you make a mistake.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel art is not for you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
